    "body": "The constructor could just create a drag data store via https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#create-a-drag-data-store and fill it in with some strings, right?  In particular, it would create a drag data store item list and put some stuff in it, set the mode to one of the modes (which one might be a constructor argument?) and leave everything as-is.",
