    "created_at": "2017-02-15T19:31:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-02-15T19:31:26Z",
    "body": "For the async clipboard API, we'd like to be able to create an empty DataTransfer object and then add items to it.\r\n\r\nFor example:\r\n```\r\nvar data = new DataTransfer();\r\ndata.items.add(\"text/plain\", \"Howdy, partner!\");\r\nnavigator.clipboard.write(data).then(function() {\r\n  console.log(“Copied to clipboard successfully!”);\r\n}, function() {\r\n  console.error(“Unable to write to clipboard. :-(”);\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n[1] Clipboard API proposal: https://github.com/garykac/clipboard/blob/master/clipboard.md\r\n[2] Async Clipboard API: https://w3c.github.io/clipboard-apis/#clipboard-interface",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/280113695/reactions",
